        {
          "id": "05b340bb-8326-415c-9e24-d273a51be2fb",
          "name": "Create distribution",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create distribution",
            "description": {
              "content": "[operation: distribution-create]\n\n\n\nMUTATING\n\n\n\nCreates and immediately publishes a distribution — a reusable assignment pool that routing rules and round-robin scheduling links reference. `name` is required: a nameless distribution is a legacy (v1) one that never appears in distribution-list and cannot be used until named. `assignmentTypeConfig` fixes what it distributes (records, meetings, or conversations). Tune weights/caps afterwards with distribution-update-v3 or distribution-adjust-v3.\n\n- assignmentTypeConfig (req): discriminated by `type`:\n\n    {type: \"Record\", handling: {type: \"WorkingHours\"}|{type: \"Strict\"}}\n    {type: \"Meeting\", handling: {type: \"Flexible\", reassignmentType: \"SameUser\"|\"AnyTeamMember\", allowPickingAssignee: bool}\n                              |{type: \"Strict\", hideAssignee: bool},\n                   limits: {type: \"MeetingLimitUnset\"}\n                           |{type: \"MeetingLimitSet\", userCaps: [{userId, limit}], resetPeriodicity: {type: \"HourlyRolling\"}|{type: \"Daily\", timeZone}|{type: \"Weekly\", timeZone, dayOfWeek(1-7)}|{type: \"Monthly\", timeZone}}}\n    {type: \"Conversation\"}\n\n- weights (opt): [{userId, weight}]; manualCalibration (opt): [{userId, count}]; capping (opt): per-user caps\n\n→\n\n    {distributionId}\n\nsee: team-list (find teamId), distribution-list (verify after)",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "org",
                "distribution"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{v1-org-distribution-Url}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "apikey": [
                {
                  "key": "key",
                  "value": "Authorization"
                },
                {
                  "key": "value",
                  "value": "{{apiKey}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "in",
                  "value": "header"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"teamId\": \"<string>\",\n  \"workspaceId\": \"<string>\",\n  \"assignmentTypeConfig\": {\n    \"type\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"name\": \"<string>\",\n  \"weights\": [\n    {\n      \"userId\": \"<string>\",\n      \"weight\": \"<integer>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"userId\": \"<string>\",\n      \"weight\": \"<integer>\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"manualCalibration\": [\n    {\n      \"userId\": \"<string>\",\n      \"calibration\": \"<integer>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"userId\": \"<string>\",\n      \"calibration\": \"<integer>\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"capping\": {\n    \"resetPeriodicity\": {\n      \"timeZone\": \"<string>\",\n      \"type\": \"<string>\"\n    },\n    \"userCaps\": [\n      {\n        \"userId\": \"<string>\",\n        \"limit\": \"<integer>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"userId\": \"<string>\",\n        \"limit\": \"<integer>\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
